    (:eng-program "(display (sixth (list 'a 'b 'c 'd 'e 'f 'g)))\n(newline)\n(display (equal? (sixth (iota 8)) (list-ref (iota 8) 5)))\n(newline)"
     :math-program "'honest-null-math ; the index-equivalence claim (sixth = π_6 = list-ref … 5) is a CS naming-alias property, not algebra."
