  :related ("cadar" "cdaar" "cdddr" "cdar" "car" "cdr")
  :learn (:concept "A composed accessor: 3 car/cdr steps fused into one name, decoded right to left." :prerequisites ("car" "cdr") :progression "Learn car and cdr, then write cddar out by hand as (cdr (cdr (car x))), then use the short name -- and keep the guard you would have written anyway.")
  :provenance "R7RS-small 6.4.1; reference record added 2026-08-02, every example executed. Conformance re-verified by execution 2026-08-02: cddar raises on a mis-shaped input, agreeing with its R7RS expansion (cdr (cdr (car pair))). An earlier version of this record flagged the opposite -- a silent non-value -- and is superseded."
