  :usecases ("Reading the GREEN channel of the first pixel of the first row." "Naming one fixed path into frames of rows of channels so the call site reads as a coordinate." "Replacing 4 hand-written car/cdr calls with one name.")
  :related ("cddaar" "caaaar" "caddar" "cadadr" "cdaar" "car")
  :learn (:concept "A composed accessor: 4 car/cdr steps fused into one name, decoded right to left." :prerequisites ("car" "cdr") :progression "Learn car and cdr, then write cadaar out by hand as (car (cdr (car (car x)))), then use the short name -- and keep the guard you would have written anyway.")
  :provenance "R7RS-small 6.4.1; reference record added 2026-08-02, every example executed. Conformance re-verified by execution 2026-08-02: cadaar raises on a mis-shaped input, agreeing with its R7RS expansion (car (cdr (car (car pair)))). An earlier version of this record flagged the opposite -- a silent non-value -- and is superseded."
