     :cs "A composed accessor is only as safe as its least-defined step, and this family keeps that guarantee -- it fails exactly where its first bad step would."))
  :row-3-dimension (
    (:setup "Take the first item, take the first item, take the first item, then drop the first 1 -- one fixed route into a nested arrangement, taken in 4 steps."
