     :claim "On any input nested deeply enough along the route ddad, cddadr equals its R7RS expansion (cdr (cdr (car (cdr x)))) and equals a hand-written path walker. Below that depth cddadr and the expansion both raise, while the hand-written walker reports 'no-such-path -- the walker is the only total one of the three, and that is a choice it makes rather than a property of the verb."
