  :provenance "R7RS-small 6.4.1; reference record added 2026-08-02, every example executed. Conformance re-verified by execution 2026-08-02: cdddar raises on a mis-shaped input, agreeing with its R7RS expansion (cdr (cdr (cdr (car pair)))). An earlier version of this record flagged the opposite -- a silent non-value -- and is superseded."
